  - title: 
    position:
      serializedVersion: 2
      x: 1744
      y: 2854
      width: 177
      height: 171
    contents: Initalizing the particles lifetime, capacity and shape/size
    theme: Classic
    textSize: Medium
  - title: 
    position:
      serializedVersion: 2
      x: 2480
      y: 3260
      width: 264
      height: 177
    contents: Updating the particles, this is where the movement of the particles
      is established
    theme: Classic
    textSize: Medium
  - title: 
    position:
      serializedVersion: 2
      x: 1588
      y: 3845
      width: 348
      height: 420
    contents: 'These are the actual particles, I once again used a smoke texture
      from the Viking Village in this project for particles. Though the way I modified
      the movement and size they appear fairly static and together in game. Overall
      his section changes the appearance of them: colour, shape, size, etc.!'
    theme: Classic
    textSize: Medium
  categories: []
  uiBounds:
    serializedVersion: 2
    x: 1588
